<architecture version="1" id="dragon-ford" name="Dragon Ford R02" units="meters" validation="playable" description="Kowloon street kit presentation of Dragon Ford R02: Kowloon Walled City-inspired 5v5 bomb-defusal blockout carved from a solid city block on four interweaving district grids. Bounded harness checks only; no balance claim.">
